    record with shape "consequence" and category "relationships" and left `have a partner who texts all day` and right `have a partner who calls every night` and consequenceA `never miss a message` and consequenceB `never miss a voice` done
    record with shape "action" and category "dating" and actionA `slow dance in a kitchen` and actionB `dance badly in a club` done
